<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_ui",
    "ASCII Art turns a word, a picture or your Hex Paint drawing into text art in mIRC colours, and posts it to a channel or a private conversation as one message. Open it from Start > Accessories > ASCII Art, the Accessories folder on the desktop, or by typing /ascii."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_notepad}>{dgettext("help_ui", "Text")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_ui",
    "Type a word or two and choose a style — blocks, hashes or a shadow — and how it is coloured: one colour, a colour on a background, a rainbow or two tones. Click a colour for the letters and right-click one for the background."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_choose_file}>{dgettext("help_ui", "Picture")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_ui",
    "Choose a picture from your computer, set how wide the art is, and draw it in colour blocks or in characters alone. The picture is read in your browser and never uploaded: only the art made from it is posted."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_paint}>Hex Paint</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_ui",
    "The Hex Paint tab draws the picture open in Hex Paint, two pixels to a character. File > Open in ASCII Art in Hex Paint comes here directly."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_file_send}>{dgettext("help_ui", "Posting and Copying")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_ui",
    "File > Post to channel… shows the art exactly as the channel will see it. It arrives as one block, every character in its column; on a narrow screen the block scrolls sideways. Edit > Copy puts the art on the clipboard with its colour codes."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_rules}>{dgettext("help_ui", "Limits")}</.help_h4>
<ul>
  <li>{dgettext("help_ui", "At most 30 lines of 100 characters in one block")}</li>
  <li>{dgettext("help_ui", "ASCII Art needs an account: visitors are asked to register")}</li>
</ul>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_link}>{dgettext("help_ui", "See Also")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  <.help_link topic="cmd-ascii">{dgettext("help_ui", "/ascii Command")}</.help_link>
  · <.help_link topic="ui-hex-paint">Hex Paint</.help_link>
  · <.help_link topic="formatting-colors">{dgettext("help_ui", "Colors")}</.help_link>
</p>
